  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "自由规划地牢布局、陷阱、雇佣怪物与宝藏位置来设计英雄旅程",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "In Dungeon Tycoon, you have complete freedom to build and manage your own dungeon. You not only design the layout, but choose the best places for whatever traps you decide to use, which monsters you will hire to face the heroes, and what treasures await those skilled enough to claim victory.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2400770/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "既要榨取英雄冒险价值，也要让他们带着收获离开以吸引回头客",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Dungeon Tycoon is all about capitalizing on every second of every hero's adventure in your mighty dungeon. Lure adventurers into your evil dungeon by summoning mighty foes, building huge and curious rooms, and a maze of deceptive opportunities. Watch how they perform and optimize every inch of your genius design. Ensure they don't go back empty-handed, so they keep coming back.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2400770/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "观察访客行为反推布局问题，再出售药水和援助品优化体验与收入",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Inspect and watch your visitors to see how you can further improve your design. Sell potions and other various aids to your visitors.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2400770/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
  "opinions": [
